					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5129</guid>
				<title>SCP-5129</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5129</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5129&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Keter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5129 is to be kept in a 15m x 15m Titanium room designed to look like a grazing field. The room is big enough to suit SCP-5129 running needs. Steel shackles are to be locked to SCP-5129 hind legs to at least slow it down. Reinforced sliding steel doors are locked in place when SCP-5129 goes on its rampage. Two foundation agents who have taken courses on exorcism and have been dispatched by their teacher are to be kept at SCP-5129&#039;s containment cell at all times.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5129 is a male horse who has the ability to open a pocket dimension inside its underbelly. SCP-5129 is normally friendly and isn&#039;t easily agitated. due to the side affects of the pocket dimension, It will go on a rampage once a week. This rampage usually lasts 1-2 hours. During the rampage, The pocket dimension opens and disembodied arms and hands burst from SCP-5129. Before recovery, these arms pillaged villages in Greece while SCP-5129 is on its rampage. The foundation members managing SCP-5129&#039;s containment cell have given it the nickname, Trojan horse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5129 was discovered in [REDACTED], Greece on a farm where it was in is docile state. There had be a number of reports that week of a number of raids and pillages at neighboring villages. Later that week while field agents where following SCP-5129, They encountered it having its rampage. The pillage resulted in 10 civilians casualties and 2 agent casualties. The first recorded rampage the foundation had of SCP-5129 lasted 1 hour. SCP-5129 was recovered /9/10/2016/. Amnestics were given to all the affiliated villages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;show&amp;nbsp;block&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;–&amp;nbsp;hide&amp;nbsp;block&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[The first breach recorded resulted in [REDACTED] casualties. After the rampage, The foundation decided to teach a exorcism course to agents assigned to SCP-5129&#039;s containment cell. &lt;strong&gt;If SCP-5129 should ever break containment, exorcism should be used to close the pocket dimension and have SCP-5129 return to its docile state.&lt;/strong&gt;]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;+&amp;nbsp;show&amp;nbsp;block&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;–&amp;nbsp;hide&amp;nbsp;block&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[ Only one experiment was recorded.&lt;br /&gt;
D-Class subject&lt;br /&gt;
Sturdy rope was fasted to a harness which was worn by the D-class subject. The other end of the rope was tightened in a spool. a camera was the attached to his head. The D class proceeded to travel into the pocket dimension that was forced open by the Field agents. When the D-class reached the other side, The camera was illuminated by a green hue. thousands of corpses could be seen in the distance. The D-class was given the other to go forward, which he heeded. The experiment was cut short because The D-class subject fell into a vat of acid under the platform he arrived at. When the footage is slowed down, a Stone throne could be seen behind the corpses. The foundation experts believe the pocket dimension to be the Greek version of the underworld. ]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
