						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-5136<br /> <strong>Object Class:</strong> Euclid</p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> To prevent any civilian entrances, SCP-5136 must be surrounded by an electrical fence and have at least 2 guards present at all times, any civilian that comes within proximity of SCP-5136 is to be informed that the Hotel is going under maintenance for an undisclosed amount of time.</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5136 is approximately 4 kilometers in length, 2 kilometers in width, and 100 meters in height, this anomaly is located in the Bahamas and is labeled “The Bahama Wonders Hotel”, the anomaly appears as a hotel, when the subject enters the Hotel they will be greeted by a man behind the desk, designated SCP-5136-1, he will be wearing formal attire. He will ask if the subject wishes to rent a room, if the subject says they are not they will be thrown out of the building from a strong force of wind, if the subject says they are looking for a room SCP-5136-2 will bring them to a random hallway, regardless if it is full or not, each hallway contains 40 doors leading to a room, these rooms are designated SCP-5136-2. For more information, read Addendum 1/332/CAI.</p> <p>Inside of SCP-5136 is a Dining Room, in it the subject will find a buffet and a beverage table, the drinks contain traces of many different types of wines, a few drops of citrus, and a currently unknown substance, the beverages induce immediate amnesia into the subject, the amount of time the subject forgets is all chance, you can forget only the last hour, or the last two years.</p> <p><strong>Addendum 1/332/CAI:</strong></p> <p>If the room's number is even, the room will be made of different colored rubbers, each step taken will make the subject comfortable, they will feel a sense of nostalgia, falling asleep will lead to supposedly the best dream they have ever had.</p> <p>If he brings the subject to an uneven