ing at some magazines, when brought back in for questioning they remembered nothing, not even the interview they just had.</p> <p><strong>Addendum 3/569/EST:</strong></p> <p>The following log is the only interview audio recording we have, the other recordings were obtained by SCP-5136-1 and have not been recovered.</p> <p><strong>INTERVIEW LOG</strong></p> <div class="blockquote"> <p><strong>Interviewed:</strong> DATA REDACTED</p> <p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> Researcher. ██████</p> <p><strong>Foreword:</strong> The following interview was conducted to find out more about the &quot;Bahama Wonders&quot; anomaly, there are 3 more interviews that are being conducted in other rooms.</p> <p><strong>&lt;Begin Log&gt;</strong></p> <p><strong>Researcher. ██████:</strong> Hello, I am Researcher. ██████, can you tell me a bit about why you went to the Bahama Wonders Hotel?</p> <p><strong>DATA REDACTED:</strong> I went on a business trip, I wanted to stay at a different Hotel but the company already paid for the rooms.</p> <p><strong>Researcher. ██████:</strong> So, there were other people with you then?</p> <p><strong>DATA REDACTED:</strong> Yeah, but I don't know what happened to them, I didn't see them get on the bus.</p> <p><strong>Researcher. ██████:</strong> They are fine I assure you, they were more than likely on a different bus. Anyways, how long have you been at the Hotel?</p> <p><strong>DATA REDACTED:</strong> I have only been there for 2 days so far.</p> <p><strong>Researcher. ██████:</strong> What have you been eating while you were there?</p> <p><strong>DATA REDACTED:</strong> The usual, burgers and pizza.</p> <p><strong>Researcher. ██████:</strong> Do you have anyone that you can stay with for a few days?</p> <p><strong>DATA REDACTED:</strong> My family is at [DATA EXPUNGED], in Illinois, I don't see why they wouldn't let me stay at my own house.</p> <p>*A knock was heard at the door, and then the door opens.*</p> <p><strong>SCP-5136-1:</strong> I hope I am not disturbing anything, but Mister. ██████, you forgot to sign out of your room, please come with me.</p> <p><strong>Researcher. ██████:</strong> Who are you? Guards, get him out of here.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5136-1:</strong> I will be needing that recorder as well.</p> <p>*SCP-5136-1 reaches for the recorder and then gets his hand slashed by the Researcher's pocket knife.*</p> <p><strong>SCP-5136-1:</strong> Well then, I suppose you can keep it for the time being.</p> <p>*SCP-5136-1 grabs the subject by the arm and carries him out of the room.*</p> <p><strong>&lt;End Log&gt;</strong></p> <p><strong>Closing Statement:</strong> When the subject and SCP-5136-1 was chased, they had disappeared.</p> </div> <p><strong>TEST LOG</strong></p> <p><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>Test A - 4/21/2001</strong></span></p> <div class="blockquote"> <p><strong>Subjects:</strong>D-3255 and D-7317</p> <p><strong>Procedure:</strong> D-3255 and D-7317 were sent to the Hotel, D-3255 was told to not eat or drink anything at the Hotel, and was told to ask if he could have a room on the second floor, and D-7317 was told they could eat and drink anything at there, and was told to ask if she could have a room on the fifth floor.</p> <p><strong>Results:</strong> When they asked about their floor specifications SCP-5136-1 said he would be taking them to whichever room he sees fit for them, after being taken to their rooms, they had an uneven numbered room. Both D-Class had survived night one, at dinner D-7317 had some of the Dining Room food and had a beverage, D-3255 had food delivered to them, after a few more nights, they were both checked out of the Hotel, D-3255 was the only person interviewed on the account of D-7317 not even being able to remember that she was a D-Class.</p> <p><strong>Analysis:</strong> After this interview it was discovered how the food in the Dining Room was in fact Amnestic, and there is a chance SCP-5136-1 assigns people that ask for specific rooms the freezing rooms.</p> </div> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5135">SCP-5135</a> | SCP-5136 | <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5137">SCP-5137</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/researcher-omicron" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6850459&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605839773" alt="Researcher Omicron" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6850459)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/researcher-omicron" >Researcher Omicron</a></span></p> 
